cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ATRIUM project hub: shared schemas, contracts and continuous integration for the ATRIUM text-processing tools, including the atrium_document record schema"
abstract: >-
  The planning and documentation hub of ÚFAL's tools for the ATRIUM project: the issues and the
  project board, the documentation site, the code shared by the tools, and the CI the tools call.
  ATRIUM is an EU project (https://atrium-research.eu). Its goal (Advancing fronTier Research In the
  arts and hUManities) is to bridge leading research infrastructures in arts and humanities (DARIAH),
  archaeology (ARIADNE), language technologies (CLARIN) and open scholarly communication (OPERAS).
